# Browser
# Plaza of Heroes: "{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a legendary spell" (CR 106.6). Unlike
# Delighted Halfling's, it has no effect on the spell. Turn 3 Bot1 taps it for {R}: the pool is {R} (LegendarySpells) with no
# "can't be countered", and the page's chip reads just "legendary". It casts Ragavan, a legendary creature, and Bot2's
# Counterspell (an Island and Mox Sapphire) counters it: the legendary spell stays counterable.

